      (font
        (size 1.8 1.8))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "debd0b0d-eb79-5de4-a702-01aaf6cc2124"))
  (text "U18 monitors +3V3: 3.07 V nominal falling threshold.\nCT intentionally open: 12-28 ms reset release delay.\nR42 limits discharge from existing MCU_EN capacitor C1.\nMCU_EN pullup R1, capacitor C1 and manual S1 are on controller."
    (at 20.32 185.42 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "47df4adf-8377-5297-8757-2c18c746778d"))
  (text "U19 SCHMITT AND: IN1=0, Y=READY AND IN0.\nIN0 is U5 pin11: LIGHT_ENABLE AND physical ARM.\nSAFE drives U13 bias, U14 SHDN, PCA OE and spot PWM gates."
    (at 218.44 124.46 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "641cb7d8-c91c-542c-a990-c49b5566b2b2"))
  (text "READY also feeds USB R41/R39; independent of ARM.\nPrototype timing and 0<V3V3<1.65 V behavior require measurement.\nAfter reset: initialize outputs OFF, verify PCA state, require fresh enable."
    (at 20.32 246.38 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.27 1.27))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "a7a5541a-869e-57f2-9b5a-0346a7622557"))
  (embedded_fonts no))